<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg PM to address EMU issues in France.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg PM to address EMU issues in France.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg Prime Minister Jean-Claude Juncker will visit France in Thursday to meet Prime Minister Alain Juppe for talks on bilateral issues and current events in Europe, the Luxembourg government press office said.</p>
<p>Juncker, also Finance Minister in the Grand Duchy, will have talks with French Economics and Finance Minster Jean Arthuis on economic and monetary union and also address a breakfast meeting on the political ambitions of EMU.</p>
</text>
